    "explanation": "India follows a mixed economy, combining both private enterprise and public-sector/government planning.\n\n💡 India's economy is like a thali with both home-cooked dishes (public sector) and restaurant-bought items (private sector) served on the same plate.\n\n⚠️ Socialist economy is tempting because of India's planning history, but private enterprise has always coexisted with the state sector.",
