    "explanation": "Women's 33% reservation in Parliament/Assemblies (the 2023 Nari Shakti Vandan Act) has been passed but is not yet actually in effect pending delimitation, so it isn't yet an operating feature, unlike the other listed traits which already hold true.\n\n💡 It's like a gym membership you've signed up for but the card hasn't been activated yet — on paper you're a member, but you can't use it yet.\n\n⚠️ Because the reservation law already exists, it feels like a genuine current feature, but implementation is still pending.",
