    "explanation": "India's public sector was set up primarily to promote social welfare and balanced development, not to chase profit like private firms.\n\n💡 Public sector units are like a community health clinic built to serve everyone, not a private hospital chasing quarterly profits.\n\n⚠️ Maximisation of profit is what most 'sector' questions expect from private firms, making it a tempting but wrong default answer here.",
