    "difficulty": "medium",
    "question": "India’s first AI teacher robot is:",
    "options": [
      "Iris",
      "Manav",
      "Mitra",
      "RADA"
    ],
    "explanation": "Iris, unveiled in 2024 at KTCT Higher Secondary School in Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala, is billed as India's first AI teacher robot; it was developed by Makerlabs Edutech in connection with the school's Atal Tinkering Lab and is a generative-AI-driven humanoid that can answer questions across subjects in three languages. Mitra is the standard trap, but it is Invento Robotics' greeter and interaction robot, not a teaching robot. Iris is a robot in sari-clad humanoid form, which is why it drew so much coverage.",
    "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
    "year": 2025,
    "paperId": "mpsc-inspector-of-excise-&-narcotics-2025-gs-iii",
    "answerIndex": 0,
